# Dinner Invitation Website - Complete Specification

## Project Overview
Build an interactive, whimsical website to ask a friend out to dinner on February 14th (Saturday). The invitation should be playful, fun, and NOT explicitly romantic. The website will track all user interactions and log them for later review.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Vanilla - no frameworks needed)
- **Styling**: Clean, whimsical, mobile-responsive design
- **Backend**: Simple logging endpoint (can be a webhook, Firebase, or simple server endpoint)
- **Assets**: Placeholder images for chibi character and flowers (to be replaced later)

