## Screen-by-Screen Flow

### Screen 1: Front Page (Welcome)
**Elements:**
- Poem text (centered, whimsical font):
  ```
  Wins upon wins,
  time to level up?
  ```
- Button: "Nom nom?"
- Chibi character (neutral/happy expression)

**Interactions to Log:**
- Page load timestamp
- Time spent on page
- "Nom nom?" button hover time
- "Nom nom?" button click timestamp

**Transition:** Fade to Screen 2

---

### Screen 2: Control Quiz
**Elements:**
- Title: "Pick ONE thing you'd like to take absolute control over:"
- 5 Options (radio buttons or clickable cards):
  1. Talking topics (I'll follow your lead on conversations)
  2. Menu items we order (You pick everything we eat)
  3. Drive anywhere location (Name the spot, we'll go there)
  4. Dessert decisions (To share or not to share, that is YOUR question)
  5. Post-dinner activity (Ice cream? Walk? Straight home? Your call)
- Chibi character (happy/neutral)
- After selection, text appears: "Deal! You've got full control over [CHOICE]. I'll handle everything else 😊"
- Button: "Sounds good!"

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on page
- Each option: hover time, hover count
- Selected option
- Time before selection
- "Sounds good!" button click timestamp

**Transition:** Slide to Screen 3

---

### Screen 3: Date Picker
**Elements:**
- Title: "When works for you?"
- 5 Date options (clickable):
  - Wed, Feb 11th
  - Thu, Feb 12th
  - Fri, Feb 13th
  - **Sat, Feb 14th** ✨ (slightly emphasized)
  - Sun, Feb 15th
- Chibi character that reacts to cursor position:
  - **Hover on Wed/Thu/Fri/Sun:** Chibi shows corresponding sad/negative expression
  - **Hover on Saturday:** Chibi shows VERY happy/excited expression

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on page
- For EACH date:
  - Total hover time
  - Hover count
  - Chibi reaction triggered (sad/happy)
- Click events with timestamp
- Order of dates attempted

**Date-Specific Behaviors:**

#### **WEDNESDAY** - Panic Mode
- **Hover:** Chibi panicked
- **Click:** 
  - Chibi brain explode/stressed
  - Message: "But it's so close! So fast! No time to plan! I have a CS match! Tomorrow?! 😵‍💫"
  - Buttons:
    - "Pick another day" → back to date picker
    - "I insist! 😤" → more panic, chibi faints, loop back
- **Log:** Click, insist attempts

#### **THURSDAY** - Impossible Button
- **Hover:** Chibi sad/skeptical
- **Desktop Click Attempt:** 
  - Button moves away from cursor on mouseenter
  - Dodges 3-5 times
  - Chibi laughs
  - Text: "Nice try! 😏 Pick another day?"
  - Button eventually disappears or shrinks
- **Mobile Tap Attempt:**
  - Button shrinks/fades each tap
  - After 3 taps: "This day really doesn't work! 😅"
  - Cannot be selected
- **Log:** Number of dodge attempts, click attempts

#### **FRIDAY** - Busy Day  
- **Hover:** Chibi tired
- **Click:**
  - Chibi very tired
  - Message: "It's such a busy dayyyyy 😩 I'll be so exhausted..."
  - Buttons:
    - "Pick another day"
    - "I insist! 😤" → shows extra exhausted chibi + "I mean... I could... but do you really want tired, zombie me at dinner? 🧟 Saturday I'll actually be fun I promise! 🙏"
      - "Fine, pick another" (bigger)
      - "I insist anyway" (smaller) → loops back
- **Log:** Click, insist attempts (count each)

#### **SATURDAY** - Perfect! 💚
- **Hover:** Chibi giggling/very happy, sparkles/hearts
- **Click:**
  - Chibi happy jump/dance
  - Confetti animation
  - Message: "That's perfect! There couldn't be a better choice! 🎉"
  - Button: "Continue" or "Let's plan it!"
- **Log:** Click timestamp, hover time
- **Transition:** To Screen 4 (Success) then Screen 5 (Planning Quiz)

#### **SUNDAY** - Hmmmm...
- **Hover:** Chibi thinking (hand on chin)
- **Click:**
  - Chibi stays thinking
  - Message: "Hmph... hmmmm... 🤔 Sunday could work... but Saturday is actually way better for both of us, don't you think?"
  - Buttons:
    - "You're right, Saturday!" (emphasized)
    - "No, Sunday works" → Chibi sighs, "Okay but... Saturday though? 🥺" loops back
- **Log:** Click, insist attempts

---

### Screen 4: Success Screen (after Saturday selected)
**Elements:**
- Happy chibi with confetti/sparkles
- Message: "That's perfect! There couldn't be a better choice! 🎉"
- Button: "Continue"

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent viewing success screen
- "Continue" click timestamp

**Transition:** Fade to Screen 5

---

### Screen 5: Planning Quiz
**Elements:**
- Title: "Let's plan the perfect evening!"
- Questions (one at a time or all on one page - recommend all on one page):

1. **Vibe check:**
   - Dress up
   - Smart casual  
   - Casual

2. **Food mood:**
   - Light & fresh
   - Comfort food
   - Heavy & hearty
   - Spicy adventure

3. **Timing:**
   - Early dinner (6pm)
   - Classic (7-8pm)
   - Late night (9pm+)

4. **Transportation:**
   - I'll drive us
   - Pick me up please
   - Meet you there

5. **Any special requests?**
   - Text input field
   - Placeholder: "Anything at all... I've got you covered ✨"

- Chibi character (happy/supportive)
- Button: "All set!"

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on page
- For each question:
  - Hover time per option
  - Time before selection
  - Selected answer
- Special requests field:
  - Time spent typing
  - Final text content
  - Whether left blank
- "All set!" button click timestamp

**Transition:** Fade to Screen 6

---

### Screen 6: Flower Selection
**Elements:**
- Title: "Pick your favorite!"
- 3 Flower images (clickable)
- Chibi character initially neutral

**On Flower Click:**
- Chibi changes to "giving flower" pose (holding selected flower)
- Quote appears based on flower:
  - **Flower 1 (Red/Rose):** "I love people who like flowers—they appreciate beauty in simple things 🌹"
  - **Flower 2 (Yellow/Sunflower):** "People who pick sunflowers are always the brightest in the room 🌻"
  - **Flower 3 (Pink/Purple):** "Soft hearts pick soft petals—and that's a beautiful thing 🌸"
- Auto-advance after 2-3 seconds OR button: "Aww, thank you!"

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on page
- Each flower: hover time, hover count
- Selected flower
- Time before selection
- Time spent viewing chibi + quote

**Transition:** Fade to Screen 7

---

### Screen 7: Feedback Quiz
**Elements:**
- Title: "So... how'd I do?"
- 4 Options (can only pick one):
  1. "This was fun!!" 😊
  2. "Could've just texted me ya know" 😏
  3. "These invitations keep getting better" 🤩
  4. "Dude, stop" 🙄

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on page
- Each option: hover time, hover count
- Selected feedback
- Time before selection

**Transition:** Fade to Screen 8

---

### Screen 8: Final Screen
**Elements:**
- Message based on feedback selection:
  - **"This was fun!!"** → "Yay! See you Saturday! 🎉" + happy chibi waving
  - **"Could've just texted me ya know"** → "Where's the fun in that? 😄 See you Saturday!" + chibi shrugging
  - **"These invitations keep getting better"** → "Just wait till next time 😎 See you Saturday!" + proud chibi
  - **"Dude, stop"** → "Never 😈 See you Saturday!" + mischievous chibi

**Interactions to Log:**
- Time spent on final screen
- Total session duration
- Session end timestamp
- Completion status: 100%

---

## Navigation & Back Buttons

**Back Button Placement:**
- Small "← Back" link in top-left corner on screens 2-6
- Not available on Screen 1 (front page), Screen 7 (feedback), or Screen 8 (final)

**Back Button Behavior:**
- Returns to previous screen
- Previous selections remain visible but can be changed
- All navigation is logged

**Logging for Back Navigation:**
- From which screen
- To which screen  
- Timestamp
- Number of times each screen is revisited
- Original selections vs changed selections

---

