        Selected: Flower 2

[01:14] 💬 Feedback (5s)
        "This was fun!!" ✓

[01:19] 👋 Final Screen (3s)

--- SUMMARY ---
Total Duration: 1m 19s
Completion: 100% ✓
Saturday Selection: Direct (no bad dates tried) 💚
Enthusiasm: High ("This was fun!!")

--- KEY INSIGHTS ---
✓ Dessert decisions most important
✓ Wants spicy food, smart casual, 7-8pm
✓ Prefers being picked up
✓ Needs vegetarian options
✓ Chose sunflower
✓ Had fun with experience!
```

