## Deployment

### Hosting Options
1. **Static Hosting (Recommended):**
   - Netlify (free, easy)
   - Vercel (free, easy)
   - GitHub Pages (free)
   - Cloudflare Pages (free)

2. **Traditional Hosting:**
   - Upload files to web server via FTP
   - Configure domain if desired

### Logging Backend Options

**Option 1: Webhook (Simplest)**
- Use Zapier or Make.com
- Create webhook that receives POST requests
- Sends data to Google Sheets or email
- No coding required

**Option 2: Firebase (Recommended)**
- Free tier sufficient
- Real-time database or Firestore
- Easy JavaScript SDK
- Query logs easily

**Option 3: Simple Server**
- Node.js Express endpoint
- Save to JSON file or database
- Host on Heroku/Railway/Render free tier

**Option 4: Email Webhook**
- Use service like FormSubmit or EmailJS
- Sends log data as email
- No server needed
- Good for one-off use

### Pre-Deployment Checklist
- [ ] Replace placeholder assets with real images
- [ ] Configure logging endpoint URL
- [ ] Test on real devices
- [ ] Verify logs are being received
- [ ] Check page load speed
- [ ] Minify CSS/JS (optional)
- [ ] Add favicon
- [ ] Test with actual link sending (text/email)

