## Notes for Claude Code

- Start with basic structure, then add interactivity
- Create placeholder assets first (colored squares with emojis)
- Build logger module early and test logging
- Mobile responsiveness is critical
- Comment code clearly for future modifications
- Keep it simple - no over-engineering
- Focus on user experience and smooth animations
- Ensure all logs capture required data
- Test thoroughly before deployment

